---
title: "High-Level Architecture — solid/filled = built and running today; dashed/hatched = planned or scaffolded-but-unused (infra container exists, zero application code references it)"
---
flowchart TB
    WEB["Angular SPA<br/>Admin · Lecturer · Student"]

    WEB -->|HTTPS REST| GW["API Gateway<br/>Spring Cloud Gateway — path-prefix routing + CORS only.<br/>No rate limiting, no gateway-level token check<br/>(each downstream service validates its own JWT statelessly)"]
    WEB -.->|WebSocket — planned, not implemented| WSG["WebSocket Gateway<br/>(design artifact only — no code exists)"]

    subgraph BUILT["Microservices Layer — Built (3 of 7) + Gateway"]
        IAM["Identity & Access"]
        ACAD["Academic Structure"]
        REF["Reference Data"]
    end

    subgraph PLANNED["Microservices Layer — Planned only (0 code exists)"]
        ENR["Enrollment"]
        GRADE["Assignment & Grading"]
        NOTIF["Notification"]
        ANALYTICS["Analytics & Reporting"]
    end

    GW --> IAM
    GW --> ACAD
    GW --> REF

    subgraph DATALAYER["Data Layer"]
        PG[("PostgreSQL<br/>one instance, one shared database 'ucms',<br/>one schema per built service — actively used")]
        REDIS[("Redis<br/>container runs — zero application code uses it.<br/>JWT validation is fully stateless, no cache lookup")]
    end

    IAM --> PG
    ACAD --> PG
    REF --> PG
    IAM -.->|not wired in| REDIS
    ACAD -.->|not wired in| REDIS
    REF -.->|not wired in| REDIS

    subgraph ASYNC["Asynchronous Backbone — not wired in"]
        MQ{{"RabbitMQ<br/>container runs — zero application code<br/>publishes or consumes any event today"}}
    end

    PLANNED -.->|would publish/consume events,<br/>once those services exist| MQ
    MQ -.-> WSG

    subgraph PIPE["Delivery Pipeline"]
        GIT["Git"] --> CI["Jenkins CI/CD<br/>multibranch pipeline — builds + tests every branch,<br/>deploys only develop / release / main"]
        CI --> DOCKER["Docker Images"]
        DOCKER --> DEPLOY["Deployed containers on one Contabo VPS<br/>(same host also runs Jenkins itself)"]
    end

    DEPLOY -.->|releases| BUILT
    DEPLOY -.->|nginx container serves the SPA and<br/>reverse-proxies /api/ to the Gateway,<br/>same-origin — no CORS needed in prod| WEB
    DEPLOY -.->|shares the one Postgres instance,<br/>already running on that host| PG

    classDef client fill:#3450D6,color:#fff,stroke:none
    classDef gateway fill:#E4E8FC,color:#161B29,stroke:#3450D6
    classDef svcBuilt fill:#FFFFFF,color:#161B29,stroke:#3450D6,stroke-width:2px
    classDef svcPlanned fill:#F4F4F4,color:#6B7280,stroke:#9CA3AF,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray: 5 3
    classDef data fill:#FBEEDC,color:#161B29,stroke:#B4791F
    classDef dataUnused fill:#F4F4F4,color:#6B7280,stroke:#9CA3AF,stroke-dasharray: 5 3
    classDef async fill:#F4F4F4,color:#6B7280,stroke:#9CA3AF,stroke-dasharray: 5 3
    classDef pipe fill:#161B29,color:#fff,stroke:none

    class WEB client
    class GW gateway
    class WSG svcPlanned
    class IAM,ACAD,REF svcBuilt
    class ENR,GRADE,NOTIF,ANALYTICS svcPlanned
    class PG data
    class REDIS dataUnused
    class MQ async
    class GIT,CI,DOCKER,DEPLOY pipe
